<title>FINLAND: Tamrock sells power plant for FIM 155 mln.</title>
<headline>Tamrock sells power plant for FIM 155 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish mining equipment group Tamrock Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it would sell its Piney Creek power plant in the United States to Colmac Clarion Inc. of the U.S. for about 155 million markka.</p>
</text>
